{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36607","headline":"和淮南李司空同转运员外 · 罗隐","name":"和淮南李司空同转运员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"层层高阁旧瀛洲，此地须徵第一流。\n丞相近年萦倚望，重才今日喜遨游。\n荣持健笔金黄贵，恨咽离筵管吹秋。\n谁继伊臯送行句，梁王诗好郢人愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36607.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36607","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}